Upstream FEX fixes (FEX-2607..FEX-2609.1, which gow3_android uses) cherry-picked onto
willfaust/FEX ios-port-2607. FEX's own commits, unchanged:
  OpcodeDispatcher: Fix 32bit cmpxchg zero extension with eax as destination operand and remove incorrect comment. (Simon Scherer)
  JIT/ALUOps: Fix operand overlapping bug for pdep (Simon Scherer)
  OpcodeDispatcher: Fix movd when prefixed with 0x66 (Simon Scherer)
  OpcodeDispatcher: Fix cvttss2si when prefixed with 0x66 (Simon Scherer)
  ALUOps: Fix 32-bit MulH case (LC)
  MiscOps: Fix round mode clearing for RP/RM modes in PushRoundingMode (LC)
  Arm64Emitter: Wire up conditional FPR spilling in SpillForPreserveAllABICall (LC)
  x87StackOptimizationPass: Fix isValid() (LC)
  Decoder: fix illegal LEA encoding (Justin Becker)
  OpcodeDispatcher: Zero OF, SF and AF for FCOMI and FCOMIF64 (Simon Scherer)
  JIT: Fix f64->i32 precision loss in non-SVE path in Vector_F64ToI32 (Simon Scherer)
  FEXCore: Fix CF calculation for BLSMSK and BLSR for 32-bit operands (Paris Oplopoios)
  OpcodeDispatcher: Fixes SHLD by 16 behaviour (Ryan Houdek)
  OpcodeDispatcher: Preserve IE exception flag for FCOMI and FTST (Simon Scherer)
  Fix x87 tag word not updating on FST ST(0) self-store (Simon Scherer)

